  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Hazard Risk Assessment and design of MHEWS in Nepal (Koshi Province)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on understanding and managing multi hazard risks in mountain regions through integrated risk assessment, MHEWS&#x2019;s, and emergency preparedness planning. WP1 centers on hazard and risk assessment. WP2 is dedicated to the development of a comprehensive multihazard early warning system approach. WP3 focuses on emergency preparedness planning and is coordinated by University of Geneva (Swiss lead) and Practical Action Consulting, Nepal (local lead).</narrative>
  </description>
